{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_03_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:11b4b9560f8164cf8d157d8ca267133ba8fbdb93f1b10125650284748d96d9a7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19934cb1db8c528ca12e8483ae0f7ca9aa99e377e0ccca3c675a58c8f30b93a",
      "text": "呼～……！今天也累趴下了。\n但是，总觉得我们稍微进步了一点吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2a3833e670995451eb53e2f5a34d7c676c41d91120b0f5a5ef52b9624ad9d6",
      "text": "是啊！啊，说起来，\n今天刚学到的这个转身动作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e331bd91a2702dd734483d8671999a7b76ab286075edf4a7be1820185c7b049",
      "text": "（那个舞步，本该能做得更流畅的。\n为什么，脑子里明明明白，身体却……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d780e21a31ee75672e0604ab6efe0a962e7fd0324d0213514a6189b8e5d34127",
      "text": "那个，薰先生。接下来我要和辉先生\n一起复习今天的训练内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4eaa15567c24af462c39ad65a0a87f9d40fb6ca1ca289015056b8bace6d0c965",
      "text": "如果可以的话，要不要一起呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:610fef3e12a4824b9deb7bca1d910d5b4761f0d5e8d281a8c8e091e67a022bf1",
      "text": "拒绝。我不想被别人打乱自己的节奏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0c64d9210e3e8094c0f8645cb9518ec500eb97f1cc0a5b2e8692f62365b94df",
      "text": "……樱庭。你这家伙，总是自己一个人加练呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4172a67e7947bc30afa5bb53451bd0ba15911eb7d605684391d53dcaeb15a371",
      "text": "你也和我们一样并不是完美的。正因为明白这点，\n你才会那么拼命去练习的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5be2c2008a52ff15c69936cf614595ab833fd2bc197906328ab983283a0b0f4",
      "text": "既然这样，三个人齐心协力的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f",
      "text": "…………唔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62c3e0b59f4211af2487e19d653105e26519393f897e9ab934865f6630c90a65",
      "text": "啊，薰先生……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4965f3129b693a8ce32e48d57441f33032d1ee43dc2680b5802d9fcdece46dae",
      "text": "……是觉得我们根本没有交流的价值么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd57921979d124e46cd82acb35d7395507bbe3b1cfe556033765b5a2f72546b3",
      "text": "……正是。让开，挡路了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c09c1a0e85646a10c6b61f3ca1d57382eb47c8c271de4cf151a513574345db1",
      "text": "……适可而止一点吧。有种把你刚才的话再说一遍！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae",
      "text": "……啧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_03_1_1_002_03:1_1_002_03_f:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff44db6db8b230c5d024d00f8bf9c45d12f1f685811e2063c4a0bc5a09324092",
      "text": "你们两个！快住手啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
